sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户
    participant Flutter as Flutter UI
    participant JS as JS im.send
    participant QJS as QuickJS Runtime
    participant Binding as native im.* binding
    participant SDK as C++ MobileImSdk / SDK hpp
    participant Cpp as C++ CoreBridge
    participant FFI as helix-driver-ffi
    participant Rust as helix-core / helix-im
    participant Go as Go Server
    participant Batch as Projection Batch Callback

    User->>Flutter: 点击发送消息
    Flutter->>JS: 调用 im.send({channelId,text,type})
    JS->>QJS: 执行 UserCase 脚本
    QJS->>Binding: 调用注入的 native im.send(input)
    Binding->>SDK: MobileImSdk::send(input)
    SDK->>SDK: 生成/归一 temporaryId 与 payload
    SDK->>Cpp: call("im_send", payloadJson)
    Cpp->>Cpp: 校验 handle / name / payload / 线程
    Cpp->>FFI: helix_command(handle, name_ptr, name_len, payload_ptr, payload_len)
    FFI->>FFI: 拷贝输入 buffer，im_send alias -> im_send_message
    FFI->>Rust: 投递 IM send command
    Rust->>Rust: 执行 IM 用例，生成 im:post:sending 乐观投影
    Rust-->>FFI: 输出 im:post:sending event
    FFI-->>Batch: on_domain_events_batch(ptr, len)
    Batch-->>Cpp: callback 期间 borrowed pointer 有效
    Cpp->>Cpp: 立即 memcpy batch，避免 callback 后悬垂指针
    Cpp-->>SDK: 入队事件批
    SDK-->>Binding: drainEvents / waitForEvent
    Binding-->>JS: 返回 {temporaryId,status:"sending"}
    JS-->>Flutter: 渲染发送中 optimistic 行
    Flutter-->>User: 看到本地发送中消息

    Rust->>Go: POST /api/cses/posts/create
    Go-->>Rust: WS post echo
    Rust->>Rust: temporaryId 对账，收敛为已发送
    Rust-->>FFI: 输出 im:post:received event
    FFI-->>Batch: on_domain_events_batch(ptr, len)
    Batch-->>Cpp: callback 期间 borrowed pointer 有效
    Cpp->>Cpp: 立即 memcpy batch
    Cpp-->>SDK: 入队事件批
    SDK-->>Binding: dispatch / drain im:post:received
    Binding-->>JS: 通知 received projection
    JS-->>Flutter: 对账 optimistic 行为真实消息
    Flutter-->>User: 渲染已发送消息

    Note over Rust,Go: Rust core 直接对接 Go Server，Flutter 不直接处理 Go 协议。
    Note over Cpp,FFI: command 返回值只表示 native 投递是否成功，业务结果通过 projection event batch 回流。
    Note over Batch,Cpp: C++ 必须在 callback 内复制事件数据，不能保存 borrowed pointer。
    Note over JS,Binding: JS 只写 UserCase 调用与断言，不再通过 js/im_api.js 或 createImApi 承载业务 facade。
